t":"How does the writer like to treat young people?","start":10.66,"end":14.13,"score":0.972,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-002","sourceId":"b4-005-002","sourceIndex":1,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"People are always talking about 'the problem of youth'.","start":16.76,"end":20.43,"score":0.976,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-003","sourceId":"b4-005-003","sourceIndex":2,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,22],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"If there is one -- which I take leave to doubt -- then it is older people who create it, not the young themselves.","start":21.25,"end":29.03,"score":0.961,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-004","sourceId":"b4-005-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,21],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Let us get down to fundamentals and agree that the young are after all human beings -- people just like their elders.","start":29.93,"end":38.15,"score":0.976,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-005-p01","sourceId":"b4-005-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":3,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"There is only one difference between an old man and a young one:","start":38.783,"end":42.59,"score":0.902,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-005-p02","sourceId":"b4-005-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":2,"parts":3,"wordRange":[13,32],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"the young man has a glorious future before him and the old one has a splendid future behind him:","start":43.27,"end":50.41,"score":0.98,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-005-p03","sourceId":"b4-005-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":3,"parts":3,"wordRange":[32,40],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"and maybe that is where the rub is.","start":50.87,"end":54.04,"score":0.942,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-006-p01","sourceId":"b4-005-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":3,"wordRange":[0,5],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"When I was a teenager,","start":55.24,"end":56.52,"score":0.924,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-006-p02","sourceId":"b4-005-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":2,"parts":3,"wordRange":[5,24],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I felt that I was just young and uncertain -- that I was a new boy in a huge school,","start":56.88,"end":62.78,"score":0.979,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-006-p03","sourceId":"b4-005-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":3,"parts":3,"wordRange":[24,41],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"and I would have been very pleased to be regarded as something so interesting as a problem.","start":63.36,"end":68.65,"score":0.995,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-007-p01","sourceId":"b4-005-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"For one thing, being a problem gives you a certain identity,","start":69.51,"end":73.44,"score":0.969,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-007-p02","sourceId":"b4-005-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[11,25],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"and that is one of the things the young are busily engaged in seeking.","start":74.16,"end":78.37,"score":0.983,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-008","sourceId":"b4-005-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,5],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I find young people exciting.","start":79.87,"end":82.06,"score":0.97,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-009","sourceId":"b4-005-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"They have an air of freedom, and they have not a dreary commitment to mean ambitions or love of comfort.","start":82.642,"end":89.84,"score":0.983,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-010","sourceId":"b4-005-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"They are not anxious social climbers, and they have no devotion to material things.","start":90.74,"end":95.94,"score":0.959,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-011","sourceId":"b4-005-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"All this seems to me to link them with life and the origins of things.","start":97.16,"end":101.55,"score":0.953,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-012","sourceId":"b4-005-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It's as if they were in some sense cosmic beings in violent and lovely contrast with us suburban creatures.","start":102.4,"end":110.48,"score":0.96,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-013","sourceId":"b4-005-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"All that is in my mind when I meet a young person.","start":112.38,"end":115.34,"score":0.974,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-014-p01","sourceId":"b4-005-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"He may be conceited, ill-mannered,  presumptuous or fatuous,","start":116.02,"end":121.7,"score":0.927,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-014-p02","sourceId":"b4-005-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[8,31],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"but I do not turn for protection to dreary cliches about respect for elders -- as if mere age were a reason for respect.","start":122.38,"end":131.1,"score":0.957,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b4-005-015","sourceId":"b4-005-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,21],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I accept that we are equals, and I will argue with him, as an equal, if I think he is wrong.","start":132.06,"end":139.08,"score":0.981,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
